   7:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *          functionalities of the Reset and Clock Control (RCC) peripheral:
   8:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
