 169:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****              the maximum frequency of the SYSCLK and HCLK is 180 MHz, PCLK2 90 MHz and PCLK1 45 MHz
