 189:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   The default reset state of the clock configuration is given below:
 190:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *            - HSI ON and used as system clock source
