 831:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
 832:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c **** /**
 833:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Enables the Clock Security System.
 834:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   If a failure is detected on the HSE oscillator clock, this oscillator
 835:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         is automatically disabled and an interrupt is generated to inform the
 836:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         software about the failure (Clock Security System Interrupt, CSSI),
 837:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         allowing the MCU to perform rescue operations. The CSSI is linked to
